      <h2>Wide Variety of Pets</h2>
      <p>From dogs and cats to rabbits and birds, we have them all!</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <h2>Trusted by Pet Lovers</h2>
      <p>Join thousands of happy pet parents who found their companion here.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
